+
+Bibkeys needed: NEEDS_BIB: `fayyaz2026steermoe`. Existing keys found and used: `wu2026toolcalling`, `khorasani2026hdmi`, `kaduri2024whatsintheimage`, `sclar2024promptformat`.
+
