+
+Numbers to double-check before submission: Stage 3 target-overlap drops in plan §5.2 should be verified against the underlying result JSON, because the individual `pilot_summary.md` files expose source-overlap and target-overlap tables but not always the exact paired Δoverlap-to-target values used in the plan. In particular, H-t-red is reported in plan §5.2 as -0.24 at L11/L17 while `stage3_cellht_red_fwd_text_myriad/pilot_summary.md` lists Best-L overlap-to-source as L01 (0.194) and layer target overlaps of 0.76 at L11/L17; H-p-red is reported as -0.19 at L11 while the pilot summary gives target overlap 0.77 at L11 and 0.81 at L17. Also verify whether the Method 4.4 sweep should be described as 45/48 cells or 45 cells: `method44_v2_sweep.json` contains 45 examples per aggregate cell over a 6x5 layer-alpha grid, while the plan says "FULL 45/48-cell sweep."

